2.42.m:
Śrī Rādhā said:
Prakṛti and Puruṣa are both forms depending mutually on one another;
they appear manifested as divided into two in this manifold world, in that manner.

2.46.m:
Vasiṣṭha said:
Proceeding on the path, he heard from sages the truth from the beginning:
the deed of the princes and the departure of his parents to heaven;
